    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until translucent, 5 to 7 minutes. Add mushrooms; season with black pepper. Cook and stir until mushrooms reduce in size and begin to brown, about 3 minutes ; stir in wine mixture. Simmer until hot, 1 to 2 minutes.",
